<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="container page-header">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
</div>

<div class="container section prose" style="max-width:760px;">
  <p>Last updated: <%= currentYear %></p>
  <p>This Privacy Policy explains what information <%= siteName %> ("we", "us") collects and how we use it. Replace this template with a policy reviewed for your specific data practices and jurisdiction before launch.</p>
  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Contact form submissions:</strong> name, email address, and message content you voluntarily submit.</li>
    <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> basic, non-identifying analytics such as pages visited, if analytics tools are enabled.</li>
    <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> a session cookie is used to keep the admin panel logged in; it is not used to track visitors.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <p>We use contact form submissions only to respond to your inquiry. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>
  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>This site contains affiliate links. Clicking them may allow the destination retailer to set their own cookies or collect data according to their own privacy policy, which we do not control. See our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">Affiliate Disclosure</a> for more.</p>
  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You may contact us at any time to request that we delete a message you submitted through our contact form.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy can be sent through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
